{"speciesId":350,"names":{"fr":"Milobellus","es":"Milotic","en":"Milotic","ja":"ミロカロス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MILOTIC is said to be the most beautiful of all the POKéMON. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MILOTIC live at the bottom of large lakes. When this POKéMON’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to restless spirits."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all POKéMON, it has been depicted in paintings and statues."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When people bicker, it is said to arise from the depths of lakes to becalm violent hearts."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring MILOTIC."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses splendides écailles aux couleurs de l’arc-en-ciel changent de teinte selon l’angle de vue."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses splendides écailles aux couleurs de l’arc-en-ciel changent de teinte selon l’angle de vue."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Milobellus est d’une beauté à couper le souffle. Ceux qui en voient un perdent aussitôt l’envie de se battre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Milotic es impresionantemente bello. Quienes lo ven, temen perder las ganas de luchar contra él."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Milotic is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ミロカロスの 美しい 姿を 見た者は 争いの 気持ちを 忘れてしまうと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le plus beau Pokémon du monde. De nombreuses œuvres d’art représentent Milobellus."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es el Pokémon más hermoso del mundo. Milotic ha inspirado numerosas obras de arte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring Milotic."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"世界一 美しい ポケモン。 ミロカロスを モデルにした 絵画や 彫刻が たくさん ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Certains prétendent que Milobellus est le plus beau de tous les Pokémon. Il a le pouvoir d’apaiser certaines émotions comme la colère ou l’hostilité, afin d’éviter les querelles inutiles."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"De Milotic se dice que es el Pokémon más bello. Tiene la capacidad de calmar sentimientos tales como el miedo y la hostilidad, y apaciguar las relaciones de áspera enemistad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Milotic is said to be the most beautiful of all the Pokémon. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"最も 美しい ポケモンと いわれている。 怒りや 憎しみの 心を 癒して 争いを 鎮める 力を 持っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Milobellus vit au fond des grands lacs. Lorsque le corps de ce Pokémon devient rose vif, il libère une pulsation d’énergie, capable d’apaiser les esprits agités."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Milotic vive en lo más profundo de los lagos. Cuando intensifica el color rosa de la piel, libera una fuerte onda de energía que tranquiliza a todo el que tenga el ánimo alterado."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Milotic live at the bottom of large lakes. When this Pokémon’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to troubled hearts."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大きな 湖の 底に すんでいる。 体が 鮮やかな ピンク色に 輝くとき 荒んだ 心を 癒す 波動を 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Célébré comme l’un des plus beaux Pokémon, il sert souvent de modèle et d’inspiration aux plus grands artistes."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que es el Pokémon más bello. Ha sido la fuente de inspiración de un gran número de artistas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"最も 美しい ポケモンとも 呼ばれ 多くの 芸術家に インスピレーションを 与えてきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il vit au fond des lacs à l’eau claire. Il se révèle aux hommes en temps de guerre et apaise leurs cœurs meurtris."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Milotic vive en lo más profundo de lagos de agua cristalina. En tiempos de guerra aparece para calmar el corazón de los hombres."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It lives at the bottom of clear lakes. In times of war, it shows itself, which soothes people’s minds and hearts."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"澄んだ 湖の 底に 棲む。 戦争が 起こるとき 現れ 人々の 心を いやす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est considéré comme le plus beau de tous les Pokémon, mais il est loin de faire l’unanimité auprès des fans de Barpau !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Dicen que es el Pokémon más bello, pero es algo que los Entrenadores forofos de los Feebas ponen en tela de juicio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"While Milotic is said to be the most beautiful Pokémon, Trainers who like Feebas and have raised it are seemingly disappointed by Milotic."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"最も 美しいと いわれるが ヒンバスが 好きで 育ててきた トレーナーには 微妙 らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le simple fait d’apercevoir cet habitant du fond des grands lacs permettrait de purifier son cœur des troubles qui l’habitent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vive en lo más profundo de los grandes lagos. Se dice que su gran belleza purifica el corazón de todos aquellos que lo contemplen."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its dwelling place is the bottom of big lakes. Those who behold its loveliness are said to have their hearts purified."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"大きな 湖の 底に 棲む。 美しい その姿は 見た者の 心の けがれを はらう という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Célébré comme l’un des plus beaux Pokémon, il sert souvent de modèle et d’inspiration aux plus grands artistes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se dice que es el Pokémon más bello. Ha sido la fuente de inspiración de un sinnúmero de artistas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"もっとも 美しい ポケモンとも 呼ばれ 多くの 芸術家に インスピレーションを 与えてきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On dit que la beauté de ce Pokémon est telle qu’elle apaise l’esprit de ceux qui le voient."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que su hermosa figura puede apaciguar el corazón de aquellos que tengan el ánimo alterado."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ミロカロスの 美しい 姿を 見た 者は 荒んだ 心が 癒されると いわれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":350,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[5,"level-up",5],[6,"level-up",5],[7,"level-up",5],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",5],[13,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[5,"level-up",40],[6,"level-up",40],[7,"level-up",40],[8,"level-up",37],[9,"level-up",37],[10,"level-up",37],[11,"level-up",37],[12,"level-up",40],[13,"level-up",40],[14,"level-up",37],[15,"level-up",37],[16,"level-up",47